omise` → Thumbnail: **\"ATOMIC HABITS\"** / Title: \"Atomic Habits Explained in Hindi | James Clear\"\n\n**Curiosity Gap:** Show a person MID-TRANSFORMATION — not the process, not the result. Someone reading a book with atomic energy radiating from it. The question: *\"What did this tiny habit actually change?\"*\n\n**Emotion:** Rank 2 — **Curiosity** (raised eyebrow energy, not shock)\n\n**Composition:** `Rule of Thirds` — book at left intersection, text at right, negative space at top\n\n---\n\n## 📋 The Final, Precise Generation Prompt\n\n```\n16:9 YouTube thumbnail, professional Photoshop-quality composition.\n\nLEFT THIRD (35% of frame):\n- The REAL \"Atomic Habits\" book by James Clear — actual published cover (cream/white, atomic dots, Penguin logo at bottom)\n- Book is tilted at 15° angle, floating slightly above a dark reflective surface\n- Subtle drop shadow beneath the book\n- Very thin warm gold rim light on the LEFT edge of the book (not glowing, just a soft edge)\n- The white book cover should have a very thin dark border/vignette so it doesn't bleed into the dark background\n\nBACKGROUND:\n- Deep dark navy blue, almost black: #080C1A\n- COMPLETELY CLEAN — no stairs, no arrows, no icons, no glow effects\n- Very subtle: a faint large circular pattern (like atomic orbits) centered in the upper-right, barely visible, 10% opacity, dark blue on dark navy\n\nRIGHT TWO-THIRDS (65% of frame, stacked text):\nLine 1: \"ATOMIC\" — massive, bold flat sans-serif (Impact or Anton font weight), color #FFD700 bright yellow, thin 3px black outline, NO metallic texture, NO bevel, NO gradient — pure flat color\nLine 2: \"HABITS\" — same massive size as ATOMIC, color #FFFFFF pure white, same flat bold style, thin 3px black outline\nLine 3: \"JAMES CLEAR\" — 30% the size of above lines, color #AAAAAA light grey, same flat bold style\n\nAll text right-aligned to frame edge with comfortable margin.\nText vertically centered in the right two-thirds.\nBottom-right corner CLEAR (no text, no elements).\n\nStyle: Clean, human-designed look, NOT over-rendered, NOT cinematic HDR, NOT AI-generated glow. Think Photoshop flat design, not Midjourney fantasy. High contrast. Readable at 120px width on phone screen.\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔁 What To Do Next\n\n1. **Paste the prompt above** into vidIQ Thumbnail Generator → `userQuery` field\n2. Set the real Atomic Habits book cover as `currentThumbnail` (reference)\n3. If it still adds a staircase — use `vidiq_refine_thumbnail` with: *\"Remove the staircase and arrow entirely. Background should be completely dark and empty except a very faint circular atomic orbit pattern at 10% opacity.\"*\n\nThe key change: **\"ATOMIC\" yellow + \"HABITS\" white** on a dead-clean background. That split-color title on two lines is what makes it pop on mobile at thumb size. Everything else should disappear."}
