ook, upper area, scattered, etc.)\n\n#### Typography (EVERY text element, top to bottom):\nFor each line of text:\n- Exact words\n- Size relative to frame (% of frame height)\n- Font style (serif/sans-serif, weight, case)\n- Color with hex code\n- Effects (flat/metallic gradient/3D bevel/textured/outlined)\n- Position (left/center/right aligned, vertical position)\n\n#### Audiobook Badge:\n- Exact text (\"AUDIOBOOK\" or \"AUDI 🎧 BOOK\")\n- Icon style (headphone type)\n- Soundwave bar count and color\n- Position in frame\n\n#### Subtitle/Tagline:\n- Any secondary text below the title\n- Which words are highlighted in a different color\n- Font size relative to main title\n\n---\n\n## TASK 2: THE ADAPTIVE THEMING RULES\n\nAfter analyzing all 13, extract the RULES for how SoulArc adapts each thumbnail:\n\nGive me a decision tree:\n- IF the book cover is [light/cream/white] → THEN background is [?], text is [?], visuals are [?]\n- IF the book topic is [psychology/mind] → THEN supporting visual is [?]\n- IF the book topic is [finance/money] → THEN accent color is [?]\n- IF the book topic is [self-help/habits] → THEN illustration style is [?]\n- etc.\n\nMap EVERY book topic to its visual treatment.\n\n---\n\n## TASK 3: RECREATION PROMPTS FOR ALL 13\n\nFor EACH of the 13 thumbnails, give me TWO prompts:\n\n### Prompt A: \"Exact Clone\" Prompt\nA prompt that recreates the EXACT thumbnail as closely as possible — same colors, same layout, same supporting visuals, same text treatment. For use in vidIQ Thumbnail Generator or ChatGPT image generation.\n\n### Prompt B: \"Same DNA, New Book\" Template\nA template version where I can swap in a DIFFERENT book but keep the exact same visual treatment. Mark swap-points with [BRACKETS].\n\nFormat each prompt as a code block I can copy-paste directly.\n\n---\n\n## TASK 4: ELEMENT LIBRARY\n\nCreate a reusable library of all the visual elements SoulArc uses across their thumbnails:\n\n### Supporting Visual Catalog:\nList every supporting 